      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BROCADE CROWN (2) hit the ground running from out wide and on speed early but faded and swamped late when 6th at Q Lakeside in Maiden company. Rates on top in this line up. JIU JITSU JANIS (8) jumped from the squeeze on debut and finished midfield at this track over 366m (20.92). Can feature with the right run. HARA'S ANCHOR (7) turned in a plain run last time when sixth at Q Lakeside over 457m behind Balmain Boy (26.37) in a Maiden. Comes through a solid form race last start. Shapes as one to consider. FRENCH APPEAL (6) is a Lucy Roche-trained newcomer by Stinger Noir out of Durham. Profiles nicely and can feature in the finish.",
